              <heading>After paragraph 5H(8)(xac)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-1__qstr-1__para-xad">
                  <num>xad</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a payment made by the Commonwealth, under the program established by the Commonwealth and known as “Youth Jobs PaTH”, to an individual placed in an internship under that program;</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
